&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cision, we believe in empowering every individual to make an impact. Here, your voice is heard, your ideas are valued, and your unique perspective fuels our collective success. As part of our global team, you&#39;ll thrive in an environment that champions curiosity, collaboration, and innovation, all while making meaningful contributions to the brands we accelerate.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in shaping the future of communication and building authentic connections that matter. Whether you&#39;re solving complex problems or driving bold innovations, your growth is our success, and together, we’ll create the conversations of tomorrow.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower your impact at Cision. Be seen, be understood, be you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales Development Representatives (SDR) play a key role in the sales process. In this role, you’ll have the opportunity to impact the growth of our business and support our sales team. The role focuses on prospecting new clients within the DACH region. You will be responsible for reaching out to potential clients to learn their current pain points with social media and sell the Brandwatch solution. This is the perfect role for someone who is number driven, self-motivated, hardworking, and a team player! Cision has an ethos of encouraging autonomy, ambition, boldness, and experimentation. We value open people who take initiative and aren’t afraid to fail, learn from mistakes, adjust, and try to get better at what they do every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Research new markets, build a pipeline of potential leads, and nurture relationships using Salesloft, Salesforce, LinkedIn, and other platforms&lt;br&gt;-Be the face of Cision.com, you are the first point of contact to engage our potential customers&lt;br&gt;-Become an expert on our brand, business, and SaaS product&lt;br&gt;-Identify points of contact within target companies and reach out to prospective clients via outbound calls, emails and social media&lt;br&gt;-Manage inbounding requests.&lt;br&gt;-Make an average of 50 outbound calls to prospects daily with the goal of scheduling platform demos&lt;br&gt;-Qualify new leads and follow up on warm leads, own your pipeline&lt;br&gt;-Nurture relationships with potential customers&lt;br&gt;-Book demos with qualified leads for your Account Executive team&lt;br&gt;-Meet and exceed quarterly targets&lt;br&gt;-Stay current on industry news and understand the social media landscape&lt;br&gt;-Growth potential, SDRs have a clear growth plan with potential to become Account Executives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Higher education or a Bachelor Degree&lt;br&gt;-Positivity and determination, ability to turn a &quot;no&quot; into a &quot;yes&quot; through consultative questioning and coping with rejection&lt;br&gt;-Native level of German language plus fluency in English&lt;br&gt;-Team player attitude, eager to be part of an ambitious team&lt;br&gt;-Ability to thrive in a quota driven environment with short and long sales cycles&lt;br&gt;-Cold calling experience an advantage&lt;br&gt;-Exceptional ability to organize work and tasks&lt;/p&gt;
